    <string name="faq_q1">How do I earn Eco-Points?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">You earn points every time you recycle at an official GreenPoint. Just tap the \'Identify at Ecopark\' button on the Home screen and scan your QR code at the machine.</string>

    <string name="faq_q2">How can I redeem my rewards?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Navigate to the Home screen and tap \'Redeem Rewards\'. You can exchange your accumulated points for bus tickets, local discounts, and other eco-friendly rewards.</string>

    <string name="faq_q3">Is the Tax Certificate official?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Yes. The certificate generated in the app is digitally signed by the municipal backend and is completely valid for local environmental tax reduction claims.</string>

    <string name="faq_q4">I forgot my password. What do I do?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">For security reasons, password resets must be done in person. Please contact your local Ecopark administration with your physical DNI to reset your access credentials.</string>

